eral container maintenance, refurbishment and repairs, container cleaning, decontamination, and container modification. Further, it provides project cargo handling, bulk, and break-bulk cargo that includes heavy machinery, large pipes, transporting liquids, and airport passenger bridges; inland transport, customs clearance, warehousing, and cargo consolidation services; and ISO tank logistics solutions for the safe transport of liquids. Additionally, the company offers various portable cabins, such as site offices, security guard cabins, portable toilets and bathrooms, portable buildings, and modular buildings; vessel and container agency; and bulk liquid solutions. The company serves agriculture, furniture and home furnishings, FMCG, retail, trade and transportation, and manufacturing industries. Lancer Container Lines Limited was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Navi Mumbai, India.","employees":112,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210480},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210479,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Lancer Container Lines\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Lancer Container Lines to seek court's nod to recover funds frozen in ₹53 lakh cyber fraud","s":"ETLegalWorld.com","d":1795001380,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["neg","legal"]},{"t":"Lancer Container Lines Updates on Cyber Fraud Incident","s":"EquityBulls","d":1794990014,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQTFBtV2ZWNzJxWXgyZ19JbDdBWGMwYWN4MThSYTFoYXpqR0hSSkJYRG42YURQVUE5dGZrOTU2Y2Z0SE1VUzNYME1QQTRzRmJoMlQ2QW50X2NzU2Q4TmV5SGQwQUp2bW1PMUVzRVBjQXl3T2RKbzZjOVVmeW9SLXFSSjJyY3dwTWdUWWdLU1dPRGFHR1dieWc?oc=5","g":["neg"]},{"t":"Lancer Container Lines Reports USD 100,000 UAE Subsidiary Fraud","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1794985662,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOMzF1YnNadVJhWXpOdHE0S1ZWRGRJNHp3ci1hWGQyN2wyUVVRcGVWSkVvZ2xSU21fYUl1MmdoeHFpTkNMTkJjbV9KX1NBamNZMUJ